OL,3,CBarrow's Georgia Stanway is back in
OL,4,Cthe WSL after sealing Arsenal move
OL,6,FBarrow-in-Furness football star
OL,7,FGeorgia Stanway is targeting more
OL,8,Ftrophies after completing a high-
OL,9,Fprofile transfer to Women's Super
OL,10,FLeague giants Arsenal.
OL,12,FThe England midfielder, 27, hails from
OL,13,FBarrow and began her journey on local
OL,14,Fpitches before launching an impressive
OL,15,Fcareer that's taken her from Blackburn
OL,16,Fand Manchester City to European
OL,17,Fpowerhouse Bayern Munich.
OL,19,FShe scored 67 goals in 186 games and
OL,20,Flifted the WSL title, three FA Cups
OL,21,Fand three League Cups.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
