OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1784294334
OL,3,CBarrow's Georgia Stanway is back in
OL,4,Cthe WSL after sealing Arsenal move
OL,6,FStanway spent four years with the
OL,7,FGerman side, collecting eight trophies
OL,8,Fand making 128 appearances, cementing
OL,9,Fher reputation as one of the top
OL,10,Fmidfielders in the women's game.
OL,12,FStanway now brings her winning
OL,13,Fmentality and Cumbrian grit to north
OL,14,FLondon, signing a permanent deal with
OL,15,Fthe Gunners after leaving Bayern at
OL,16,Fthe end of the season.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
