OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1784294334
OL,3,CBarrow's Georgia Stanway is back in
OL,4,Cthe WSL after sealing Arsenal move
OL,6,FOn the international stage, Stanway
OL,7,Fhas earned 93 caps for England and was
OL,8,Finstrumental in both of the Lionesses'
OL,9,FEuropean Championship triumphs in 2022
OL,10,Fand 2025.
OL,12,FSpeaking about her latest move, the
OL,13,FBarrow native said: "It's an
OL,14,Funbelievable feeling, and I'm so proud
OL,15,Fto be joining Arsenal.
OL,17,F"This is a massive club that is
OL,18,Fdriving the women's game forward to
OL,19,Fnew levels, and I want to be a part of
OL,20,Fit.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,370,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1784294334
OL,3,CBarrow's Georgia Stanway is back in
OL,4,Cthe WSL after sealing Arsenal move
OL,6,F"I want to win trophies and grow as a
OL,7,Fplayer, and this is the right place to
OL,8,Fdo that with the backing of an
OL,9,Fincredible fanbase."
OL,11,FArsenal boss Renee Slegers praised
OL,12,FStanway's talent and experience,
OL,13,Fsaying: "Georgia is a brilliant
OL,14,Fmidfielder and we're thrilled that she
OL,15,Fis an Arsenal player.
OL,17,F"She will add a new dimension to our
OL,18,Fmidfield, bringing experience and
OL,19,Fadding to our winning mentality."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
