OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1784294334
OL,3,CBarrow's Georgia Stanway is back in
OL,4,Cthe WSL after sealing Arsenal move
OL,6,FDirector of Women's Football Clare
OL,7,FWheatley added: "We're delighted to
OL,8,Fbring Georgia to Arsenal. She brings
OL,9,Fstrong leadership, character and
OL,10,Fcompetitiveness, and I know our
OL,11,Fsupporters will enjoy watching her
OL,12,Fplay in red and white."
OL,14,FStanway's move is another proud moment
OL,15,Ffor football fans in Barrow and across
OL,16,FCumbria, who will be cheering on their
OL,17,Fhometown hero as she aims for more
OL,18,Fsilverware with Arsenal in the seasons
OL,19,Fahead.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
